WEBVTT

01:40.740 --> 01:45.700
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.240 --> 01:50.979
[Episode 20]

02:03.350 --> 02:04.680
Zui, look at this.

02:07.070 --> 02:09.430
Yitan, thank you for accompanying me to the night market.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.000
Here.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.630
There's a lion dance up ahead.

02:14.630 --> 02:15.760
Let's go take a look.

02:18.750 --> 02:22.030
Bravo! Bravo!

02:23.630 --> 02:28.000
Bravo! Bravo!

02:32.590 --> 02:39.750
Bravo! Bravo!

02:53.400 --> 02:54.240
Yitan,

02:54.870 --> 02:55.960
I like you!

02:56.400 --> 02:56.960
Bravo!

03:00.280 --> 03:01.430
That's quite impressive.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.030
Look.

03:02.520 --> 03:06.120
Bravo! Bravo!

03:06.630 --> 03:08.430
Did you just say something to me?

03:15.060 --> 03:17.390
Yitan, I like you!

03:19.460 --> 03:21.200
♪ The tall trees are intertwined ♪

03:21.770 --> 03:23.060
♪ You are so close to me ♪

03:23.640 --> 03:26.360
♪ In the wind and moonlight, my amorous feelings linger ♪

03:24.520 --> 03:28.000
Not only because of your indulgence and tolerance,

03:27.040 --> 03:28.829
♪ You gallop on horseback ♪

03:28.680 --> 03:30.210
trust and respect,

03:29.250 --> 03:30.780
♪ As if you came as soon as you heard the news ♪

03:31.260 --> 03:33.970
♪ You want to rekindle the stars in my eyes ♪

03:32.870 --> 03:34.650
but also because you protect me,

03:34.650 --> 03:36.410
♪ Through the troubled times filled with beacon fires and chaos ♪

03:35.120 --> 03:36.240
fight for me,

03:36.690 --> 03:38.070
♪ We watch the spring blossoms and autumn fruits ♪

03:37.170 --> 03:39.430
and silently stand behind me.

03:38.920 --> 03:41.800
♪ Only you make me feel at ease ♪

03:41.840 --> 03:43.340
Every day, I feel that

03:42.350 --> 03:44.220
♪ I want to ♪

03:43.590 --> 03:45.000
being with you

03:44.750 --> 03:46.360
♪ Look into your eyes day after day ♪

03:45.470 --> 03:46.990
gives me something to look forward to.

03:46.910 --> 03:49.940
♪ But my heartfelt words are hidden behind my lips ♪

03:49.400 --> 03:51.680
I would never give someone
as wonderful as you

03:50.530 --> 03:53.420
♪ Watching you under the setting sun's afterglow ♪

03:53.710 --> 03:55.400
up to someone else.

03:53.940 --> 03:57.030
♪ Is so meaningful and lasting, just like a dream ♪

03:58.630 --> 04:00.990
♪ In that distant light, it's all about ♪

04:02.070 --> 04:04.320
♪ The rest of my life that I'm longing for ♪

04:05.070 --> 04:07.170
I know what you're worried about.

04:06.530 --> 04:07.770
♪ Time slips away ♪

04:08.730 --> 04:11.500
♪ In this life, I'm arrogant and overbearing just for you ♪

04:09.910 --> 04:12.030
No matter what happens in the future,

04:12.550 --> 04:15.920
♪ I wish that from now on, when the flowers bloom ♪

04:14.000 --> 04:16.920
I will have the confidence
to face it with you.

04:17.120 --> 04:19.959
♪ We are all the same ♪

04:17.920 --> 04:20.980
Even if we can only be together for a year,

04:21.120 --> 04:23.190
a month, or a day,

04:22.180 --> 04:25.270
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

04:23.720 --> 04:26.040
I just want to be with you.

04:26.150 --> 04:29.030
♪ It makes me restrained yet infatuated ♪

04:30.090 --> 04:33.110
♪ Do you know the feeling of gathering the morning flowers in the evening? ♪

04:30.160 --> 04:31.160
Yitan,

04:31.830 --> 04:35.510
will you give me this chance?

04:33.640 --> 04:36.840
♪ It's the most regrettable thing ♪

04:37.750 --> 04:40.920
♪ Do you know that staying together for a lifetime ♪

04:41.630 --> 04:44.600
♪ Is the most beautiful vow I've ever made? ♪

04:45.320 --> 04:47.290
♪ Do you know your name ♪

04:48.020 --> 04:49.270
♪ Is the shortest love poem ♪

04:49.920 --> 04:54.970
♪ I've ever read? ♪

05:10.990 --> 05:13.300
♪ Watching you under the setting sun's afterglow ♪

05:14.400 --> 05:17.030
♪ Is so meaningful and lasting, just like a dream ♪

05:18.860 --> 05:21.450
♪ In that distant light, it's all about ♪

05:22.150 --> 05:24.780
♪ The rest of my life that I'm longing for ♪

05:24.720 --> 05:25.720
What should we do?

05:26.600 --> 05:29.270
I feel like I'm marrying off
my daughter right now.

05:26.760 --> 05:27.970
♪ Time slips away ♪

05:28.930 --> 05:31.700
♪ In this life, I'm arrogant and overbearing just for you ♪

05:30.800 --> 05:33.159
If Yang Yitan dares to mistreat Zui,

05:32.750 --> 05:36.190
♪ I wish that from now on, when the flowers bloom ♪

05:34.159 --> 05:35.310
I'll break his legs.

05:36.390 --> 05:37.870
Yitan's our second brother.

05:36.980 --> 05:40.310
♪ We are all the same ♪

05:38.630 --> 05:40.360
Besides, can you even beat him?

05:42.159 --> 05:43.390
These fireworks were set off

05:42.380 --> 05:45.470
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

05:43.800 --> 05:46.040
at just the right moment, don't you think?

05:46.040 --> 05:47.830
Exactly. As soon as the fireworks went off,

05:46.350 --> 05:49.230
♪ It makes me restrained yet infatuated ♪

05:47.920 --> 05:50.180
the atmosphere immediately came alive.

05:50.290 --> 05:53.310
♪ Do you know the feeling of gathering the morning flowers in the evening? ♪

05:51.800 --> 05:53.200
If only Hongye were here.

05:53.840 --> 05:57.040
♪ It's the most regrettable thing ♪

05:54.600 --> 05:56.240
Why do you think he didn't come?

05:56.240 --> 05:57.960
Even you feel like you're marrying off your daughter.

05:57.950 --> 06:01.120
♪ Do you know that staying together for a lifetime ♪

05:58.120 --> 05:59.850
What do you think he would feel?

06:01.220 --> 06:02.630
Then who set off these fireworks?

06:01.830 --> 06:04.800
♪ Is the most beautiful vow I've ever made? ♪

06:03.750 --> 06:06.170
I don't think it's Qingmu who arranged this.

06:05.520 --> 06:07.490
♪ Do you know your name ♪

06:06.920 --> 06:07.800
Right.

06:08.220 --> 06:09.470
♪ Is the shortest love poem ♪

06:08.390 --> 06:09.800
Who's so talented?

06:10.120 --> 06:15.500
♪ I've ever read? ♪

06:21.780 --> 06:24.790
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

06:24.360 --> 06:26.630
It seems everything went smoothly.

06:25.470 --> 06:28.400
♪ It makes me greedy yet selfless ♪

06:28.270 --> 06:30.100
Your fireworks finale was perfect.

06:29.340 --> 06:32.500
♪ Do you know ♪

06:30.350 --> 06:31.350
Thanks a lot.

06:32.480 --> 06:33.920
Then as a reward,

06:33.180 --> 06:36.240
♪ You've become my tear mole? ♪

06:34.120 --> 06:35.450
watch the stars with me.

06:37.200 --> 06:40.200
♪ Oh, do you know that even though time passes by ♪

06:38.050 --> 06:38.909
I don't want to.

06:41.110 --> 06:43.990
♪ I'll still be honest with you? ♪

06:41.180 --> 06:42.000
Yes, you do.

06:44.970 --> 06:46.700
♪ Do you know the sunset ♪

06:47.340 --> 06:48.670
♪ Is the warmest beginning ♪

06:49.230 --> 06:54.820
♪ When I fell in love with you? ♪

06:56.640 --> 06:58.740
♪ Do you know the sunset ♪

06:59.350 --> 07:00.580
♪ Is the warmest beginning ♪

07:01.820 --> 07:11.030
♪ When I fell in love with you? ♪

07:08.750 --> 07:11.810
"The stone steps are as cool
as cold water in the night."

07:12.000 --> 07:15.530
"Seated silently at the palace and
staring at Altair and Vega."

07:25.920 --> 07:27.650
At this moment, I'm thinking of

07:28.750 --> 07:31.680
the first person who told me
stories about the stars.

07:33.720 --> 07:36.200
That must have been... A gentle person.

07:39.800 --> 07:40.730
It was my mother.

07:42.270 --> 07:43.870
Her name was also beautiful.

07:44.680 --> 07:45.750
Jiang Juanxue.

07:49.040 --> 07:50.100
A very poetic name.

07:51.240 --> 07:51.950
Indeed.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.200
Although she passed away many years ago

07:56.950 --> 07:59.390
and I can't remember some things clearly,

08:01.240 --> 08:02.720
every time I see the stars,

08:03.720 --> 08:05.000
I think of her.

08:06.830 --> 08:07.720
And I remember

08:09.120 --> 08:10.750
the things she told me.

08:13.630 --> 08:14.510
Huaizhu,

08:15.750 --> 08:17.430
look at the stars in the sky.

08:18.040 --> 08:19.370
Aren't they beautiful?

08:23.160 --> 08:25.490
Although the weather is not good tonight,

08:26.190 --> 08:27.510
once the wind passes,

08:28.160 --> 08:30.560
the stars will come out eventually.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.390
Perhaps one day,

08:40.549 --> 08:43.630
darkness will envelop your life.

08:45.310 --> 08:47.240
But you must believe

08:48.360 --> 08:52.030
that there will surely be stars
to light your path.

09:04.320 --> 09:07.200
My mother left me a riddle.

09:09.570 --> 09:10.970
I need to find the answer.

09:12.830 --> 09:13.970
Do you need my help?

09:17.090 --> 09:19.350
This is something I need to face on my own.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.850
Why are you smiling?

09:27.390 --> 09:28.850
You came to see me today,

09:29.440 --> 09:31.640
seemingly with something on your mind.

09:32.590 --> 09:33.760
Are you...

09:34.640 --> 09:35.830
Leaving as well?

09:44.880 --> 09:45.980
This time,

09:47.270 --> 09:48.870
I'll be away for a bit longer.

09:48.940 --> 09:50.470
But you don't need to worry.

09:50.650 --> 09:52.180
Before summer ends,

09:52.610 --> 09:54.140
I’ll definitely come back.

10:00.110 --> 10:01.700
Of course I won't worry.

10:03.910 --> 10:05.280
Because in this world,

10:06.200 --> 10:08.150
there are very few humans or demons

10:08.680 --> 10:09.880
that can kill you now.

10:24.750 --> 10:25.550
What is it?

10:25.670 --> 10:27.670
My Lady, as you instructed,

10:27.790 --> 10:29.960
if there's any information about
Master Zhang Zheng,

10:29.960 --> 10:31.890
we must report to you immediately.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.630
What's the information?

10:33.630 --> 10:35.710
Master Zhang has disguised himself

10:35.840 --> 10:37.270
and entered the Beast Kingdom again.

10:37.270 --> 10:38.330
The Beast Kingdom?

10:48.900 --> 10:51.560
This is already his third time
there this month.

10:52.520 --> 10:55.610
What exactly is in this Beast Kingdom

10:56.550 --> 10:58.080
that binds him so?

10:58.750 --> 10:59.720
My Lady.

10:59.870 --> 11:02.870
Is Master Zhang really
that important to you?

11:03.320 --> 11:04.780
What are you trying to say?

11:04.870 --> 11:06.190
All these years,

11:06.240 --> 11:09.270
you've repeatedly invited Master Zhang
to Ruyi Pavilion,

11:09.270 --> 11:11.070
but he has never shown up.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.630
He wasn't like this before.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.900
Back when we were classmates,

11:19.750 --> 11:20.950
he was very kind to me.

11:22.030 --> 11:23.510
He even saved my life once.

11:38.870 --> 11:40.300
Why aren't we there yet?

11:40.320 --> 11:41.630
It's just ahead.

12:02.150 --> 12:05.320
This doesn't look like a place where
night-blooming cereus would bloom.

12:05.320 --> 12:07.320
Are you sure this is the right place?

12:17.470 --> 12:18.750
What are you doing?

12:18.840 --> 12:19.720
We're all classmates.

12:19.720 --> 12:21.010
Stop fooling around.

12:21.270 --> 12:22.750
Miss Qingmu.

12:23.550 --> 12:24.670
Aren't you so great that

12:24.670 --> 12:26.130
you look down on everyone?

12:26.360 --> 12:27.820
Without light,

12:27.850 --> 12:30.510
I'd like to see how you'll escape
this nightmare formation.

12:30.510 --> 12:31.320
Let's go.

12:31.390 --> 12:32.390
Stop right there!

12:36.010 --> 12:38.340
Please don't go! Don't go!

12:59.750 --> 13:01.750
Father! Mother!

13:08.510 --> 13:10.170
Are you alright, Miss Qingmu?

13:10.240 --> 13:11.370
I'm here to save you.

13:18.790 --> 13:19.910
Classmate Zhang.

13:47.750 --> 13:48.680
Don't be afraid.

13:49.150 --> 13:50.480
I'll get you out of here.

13:51.870 --> 13:52.600
Let's go.

14:03.600 --> 14:06.150
These are all manifestations of
your inner fears.

14:06.150 --> 14:07.080
Don't be afraid.

14:07.440 --> 14:08.440
I'm here with you.

14:09.150 --> 14:09.950
It's alright.

14:19.150 --> 14:19.750
Let's go.

14:26.030 --> 14:26.550
Hurry.

15:09.510 --> 15:11.320
Thank you, Classmate Zhang.

15:15.960 --> 15:17.890
We were classmates for many years.

15:17.910 --> 15:19.570
Although he didn't talk much,

15:19.670 --> 15:21.200
he was extremely kind to me.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.660
He was a very, very nice person.

15:24.080 --> 15:25.540
What happened after that?

15:25.750 --> 15:29.050
Later, he became Master Zhang Zheng.

15:29.550 --> 15:32.610
Since then, his temperament has changed drastically.

15:33.240 --> 15:34.580
As you've seen,

15:35.150 --> 15:38.150
I've invited him as the owner of Ruyi Pavilion several times,

15:38.150 --> 15:39.510
but he has refused every time.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.550
Why?

15:41.150 --> 15:42.280
I don't know either.

15:43.280 --> 15:45.750
Since he's not interested, you might
as well give up.

15:45.750 --> 15:47.630
My Lady, you shouldn't bother with him anymore.

15:47.630 --> 15:50.360
There are a lot of people who
admire you, My Lady.

16:00.700 --> 16:02.230
But I just can't let him go.

16:03.600 --> 16:05.400
Things from our youth

16:05.670 --> 16:06.720
sometimes

16:06.960 --> 16:08.010
last a lifetime.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.540
Zhang Zheng.

16:12.870 --> 16:16.150
What exactly have you been going to
the Beast Kingdom for?

16:22.870 --> 16:23.750
It's your turn, Zizai.

16:23.750 --> 16:24.290
Yitan.

16:24.320 --> 16:25.060
Look at this.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.800
This is not ordinary at all.

16:26.840 --> 16:27.510
Hongye.

16:27.750 --> 16:31.550
Have you told Huaizhu that you're going to

16:31.920 --> 16:33.910
the Beast Kingdom to investigate
the Black Fox?

16:33.910 --> 16:35.510
She has important matters to attend to.

16:35.510 --> 16:36.540
I don't want to hinder her.

16:36.540 --> 16:37.440
How was it? Aren't I impressive?

16:37.440 --> 16:40.390
You two have just gotten together,
and now you have to separate.

16:40.390 --> 16:41.720
Is this going to be okay?

16:42.320 --> 16:44.840
Why don't you go back and stay with Huaizhu?

16:44.960 --> 16:46.690
Yitan and I can go by ourselves.

16:47.550 --> 16:49.030
Zui has a point.

16:51.390 --> 16:53.830
Have you arranged for someone to
meet us in the Beast Kingdom?

16:53.830 --> 16:55.030
Rest assured, Hongye.

16:55.030 --> 16:57.160
I've arranged the best person for you.

16:57.240 --> 16:58.080
Who is it?

16:59.040 --> 16:59.950
It's me.

17:01.630 --> 17:02.510
You?

17:04.440 --> 17:07.270
The ruler of the Beast Kingdom has always
harbored resentment towards you, Hongye.

17:07.270 --> 17:09.160
If we're not careful with this mission,

17:09.160 --> 17:11.310
your whereabouts could be exposed, Hongye.

17:11.310 --> 17:12.510
So I've decided

17:12.589 --> 17:16.450
to personally oversee the Ruyi Pavilion branch
in the Beast Kingdom.

17:16.810 --> 17:19.160
The sun must be rising from the south today.

17:19.160 --> 17:21.810
Miss Qingmu is actually going
on a mission herself?

17:21.810 --> 17:22.869
Is there a problem?

17:23.270 --> 17:26.280
But I heard the Beast Kingdom
is very far away.

17:26.400 --> 17:28.880
And the weather is extremely dry.

17:29.070 --> 17:31.500
It's not good for your skin care, Qingmu.

17:32.400 --> 17:35.220
Don't worry. I've already thought of that.

17:35.790 --> 17:37.270
Besides, all my cosmetics

17:37.270 --> 17:38.930
have already been sent ahead.

17:39.000 --> 17:42.090
You'll have to get up early for the mission.

17:43.070 --> 17:44.730
Is there anyone more suitable

17:44.790 --> 17:46.650
for early morning tasks than you?

17:49.240 --> 17:50.530
It's decided then.

17:51.030 --> 17:53.070
I'll go to the Beast Kingdom first to scout things out.

17:53.070 --> 17:55.800
Someone will be there to meet you
when you arrive.

17:57.310 --> 17:58.030
I'm off.

18:00.350 --> 18:01.680
She just left like that?

18:07.400 --> 18:08.240
Yitan,

18:08.550 --> 18:11.500
did you see anything with your
Clairvoyance Eye just now?

18:11.500 --> 18:14.450
Qingmu was acting a bit strange.

18:15.510 --> 18:17.590
We can trust Qingmu to handle things.

18:18.600 --> 18:20.660
Before I set off to the Beast Kingdom,

18:20.680 --> 18:23.480
there's one last important matter
to take care of.

18:26.350 --> 18:27.240
Yang Yitan.

18:37.600 --> 18:38.260
Hongye.

18:38.850 --> 18:40.120
W-What is it?

18:40.480 --> 18:42.210
Calling Yitan by his full name,

18:42.550 --> 18:43.590
it's kind of scary.

18:43.590 --> 18:44.400
Yang Yitan.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.310
The favorite of the Mask Group

18:46.310 --> 18:48.590
as well as the entire Wangquan Manor

18:48.770 --> 18:50.030
proposed to you in public,

18:50.030 --> 18:52.350
disregarding ethics and propriety.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.550
Don't you have anything to say about it?

18:54.550 --> 18:56.550
Don't you have anything to say about it?

18:56.550 --> 18:57.750
Don't you have anything to say about it?

18:57.750 --> 18:59.150
Anything to say about it?

19:02.440 --> 19:04.050
Don't bully the honest one.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.310
Please rest assured, Hongye.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.750
I'll go get ready right away.

19:08.750 --> 19:11.000
As for the three letters and six rites,
not a single one will be missing.

19:11.000 --> 19:13.830
Have your grandfather and uncle
come in person.

19:14.640 --> 19:15.370
Understood.

19:18.790 --> 19:19.980
That's more like it.

19:20.040 --> 19:22.170
Marry Miss Wangquan,

19:22.240 --> 19:24.300
then give me a chubby grandson,

19:24.550 --> 19:27.680
and the position of the Yang family master
will be yours.

19:27.720 --> 19:30.720
Tell me, what grudge could there be
between us, Yitan?

19:31.680 --> 19:33.350
Yang Ying! Yang Ying!

19:36.160 --> 19:36.750
Father.

19:38.000 --> 19:41.160
What's the good news? Why are you shouting
so early in the morning?

19:41.160 --> 19:42.710
It's great news!

19:43.030 --> 19:44.720
Quickly, go to the butler's place

19:44.720 --> 19:45.750
and personally oversee

19:45.750 --> 19:47.000
the preparation of the betrothal gifts.

19:47.000 --> 19:49.000
Come with me to the Wangquan family.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.260
It's great news.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.920
Oh, my grandson.

19:53.730 --> 19:57.030
[Wangquan Manor]

19:55.240 --> 19:57.290
The auspicious date chosen by
the Taoist priest

19:57.110 --> 20:02.250
[Unparalleled Sword]

19:57.510 --> 19:58.680
is December 5th.

20:00.400 --> 20:02.460
We still have a few months to prepare.

20:02.590 --> 20:04.290
Miss Wangquan is marrying down
into our family.

20:04.290 --> 20:06.380
It must be a grand affair.

20:07.030 --> 20:10.590
However, our Yang family is not as wealthy
as your Wangquan family.

20:10.590 --> 20:15.240
I wonder if you're satisfied with these
betrothal gifts, Young Master.

20:15.240 --> 20:18.070
Our Zui doesn't lack gold, silver, or jewels.

20:18.150 --> 20:19.190
Sure. Sure.

20:20.160 --> 20:23.890
I just wonder, when our Zui marries down
into your Yang family,

20:24.840 --> 20:26.420
what will her status be?

20:28.320 --> 20:30.880
Will she be the wife of the Young Master
of the Yang family?

20:30.880 --> 20:33.480
She'll surely be the wife of
our family master.

20:34.750 --> 20:37.630
On the day Miss Wangquan marries
into the Yang family,

20:37.630 --> 20:41.960
I will pass the position of
family master to Yitan.

20:46.200 --> 20:48.400
Uncle Ying, do you have any objections?

20:49.350 --> 20:50.400
I wouldn't dare.

20:50.870 --> 20:53.750
After all, she's the daughter of
the Wangquan family.

20:53.750 --> 20:55.240
With the hierarchy and propriety involved,

20:55.240 --> 20:57.960
how could we possibly be more significant
than the Wangquan family?

20:57.960 --> 20:59.560
I heard that you, Uncle Ying,

20:59.680 --> 21:02.380
have accumulated a lot of
gambling debts out there.

21:02.380 --> 21:03.730
No, absolutely not.

21:04.620 --> 21:07.620
Young Master Wangquan, don't you
believe the rumors.

21:11.270 --> 21:15.160
But this has your signature and
fingerprints on it, Uncle Ying.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.480
[IOU]

21:18.240 --> 21:19.170
Young Master...

21:19.270 --> 21:20.600
[IOU]

21:20.040 --> 21:22.560
Of course, since we're all family now,

21:23.400 --> 21:24.800
Uncle Ying, your matters

21:25.560 --> 21:27.690
are the matters of the Wangquan Manor.

21:28.920 --> 21:30.880
Thank you, Young Master Wangquan.

21:31.750 --> 21:35.080
The Wangquan Manor is indeed
the cream of the Yiqi Alliance.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.880
What virtue or ability does our
Yang family have

21:36.880 --> 21:38.720
to be worthy of an alliance with
the Wangquan family?

21:38.720 --> 21:40.460
This is truly a blessing of three lifetimes.

21:40.460 --> 21:42.000
Our humble abode is illuminated
by your presence.

21:42.000 --> 21:42.930
There's no rush.

21:43.510 --> 21:45.710
I have another gift for you, Uncle Ying.

21:48.540 --> 21:49.900
I bought two mines.

21:50.710 --> 21:51.590
Jade mines.

21:52.660 --> 21:54.840
Young Master, you're too generous.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.880
Well, a good business opportunity
waits for no one.

21:56.880 --> 21:59.830
Uncle Ying, please leave for Nanchui immediately
to make your fortune.

21:59.830 --> 22:01.080
Nan... Nanchui?

22:01.270 --> 22:02.770
But Nanchui is a chaotic mix
of humans and demons.

22:02.770 --> 22:04.030
Is the carriage ready?

22:04.200 --> 22:05.030
Yes, everything's ready.

22:05.030 --> 22:06.200
I... I still have my family.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.170
Young Master Yang, your legitimate wife
and concubines,

22:08.170 --> 22:09.800
along with three mistresses

22:09.920 --> 22:11.310
as well as seven children

22:11.310 --> 22:12.750
have all been gathered.

22:13.130 --> 22:15.430
They're all in the carriage
outside the manor.

22:15.430 --> 22:16.510
It seems...

22:17.160 --> 22:19.160
They've already started fighting.

22:19.510 --> 22:24.240
What are you waiting for? Escort Uncle Ying to make his fortune
in Nanchui right away.

22:24.720 --> 22:25.480
Please.

22:26.260 --> 22:27.980
Father, say something!

22:49.200 --> 22:51.730
I'm very satisfied with the betrothal gifts.

22:52.130 --> 22:54.610
December 5th, it's settled then.

23:02.560 --> 23:09.450
[Unparalleled Sword]

23:03.800 --> 23:05.030
They have been sent off.

23:05.030 --> 23:06.200
Before he even got on the carriage,

23:06.200 --> 23:08.200
his legitimate wife and mistresses

23:08.240 --> 23:11.170
had already scratched his face
beyond recognition.

23:12.110 --> 23:13.680
Send a message to Poison King.

23:13.680 --> 23:15.220
Tell him I don't want this person

23:15.220 --> 23:17.020
to leave Nanchui for even a step.

23:17.270 --> 23:17.750
Yes.

23:25.150 --> 23:26.210
Alright, come out.

23:29.950 --> 23:33.430
[Unparalleled Sword]

23:31.230 --> 23:32.490
You heard everything?

23:33.750 --> 23:35.680
I heard you bullying people with your power,

23:35.680 --> 23:38.400
sending them off to Nanchui without even
letting their feet touch the ground,

23:38.400 --> 23:40.770
and forbidding them from ever coming back.

23:40.770 --> 23:41.340
Zui.

23:43.670 --> 23:44.270
Catch it.

23:46.150 --> 23:48.410
The apples offered to our ancestors will

23:48.750 --> 23:50.410
bring us good luck and safety.

23:50.450 --> 23:51.640
If you're against it,

23:51.280 --> 23:57.630
[Unparalleled Sword]

23:51.750 --> 23:52.880
I can call him back.

23:53.240 --> 23:54.240
I am against it.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.930
Because you're too kind to him.

23:56.930 --> 23:58.270
You even bought him mines,

23:58.270 --> 23:59.530
and two of them at that.

23:59.870 --> 24:01.670
What I bought is your reputation

24:01.680 --> 24:03.740
after marrying into the Yang family.

24:04.500 --> 24:05.760
That's still not okay.

24:06.830 --> 24:09.080
Whenever I think of Aunt Yang Yan,

24:09.590 --> 24:10.920
I get angry.

24:11.850 --> 24:13.110
Then think about this.

24:13.550 --> 24:16.380
Why would they sell such profitable mines?

24:17.510 --> 24:19.110
Is it possible that there are

24:19.110 --> 24:22.350
some bad debts or grudges involved?

24:27.270 --> 24:28.460
Now that's more like it.

24:28.460 --> 24:29.860
This is the Hongye I know.

24:29.880 --> 24:30.880
Ruthless enough.

24:40.010 --> 24:41.000
Zui,

24:43.350 --> 24:44.000
I...

25:05.940 --> 25:08.670
Aren't there still a few months
before I get married?

25:08.670 --> 25:11.270
There's still time for this kind of fussy talk.

25:11.310 --> 25:12.310
You hold it in.

25:12.590 --> 25:14.790
We'll talk about it when the time comes.

25:20.470 --> 25:21.840
Well, Hongye, you're also quite busy.

25:21.840 --> 25:24.080
You still need to get ready for your trip
to the Beast Kingdom.

25:24.080 --> 25:24.940
I'll leave now.

25:34.890 --> 25:35.480
Hongye.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.360
Thank you.

25:41.580 --> 25:43.510
I hope you'll be happy too, Hongye.

26:17.670 --> 26:20.550
I've been cultivating with that leech demon
for quite some time.

26:20.550 --> 26:24.350
I hope this time, I can break through
the limitations of my bloodline

26:24.690 --> 26:27.220
and control the true Divine Fire.

27:00.750 --> 27:01.920
Jin Renfeng.

27:03.550 --> 27:04.310
Tell me,

27:04.970 --> 27:06.400
what can I gain

27:06.960 --> 27:08.160
by serving under you?

27:08.880 --> 27:10.410
Opportunities, of course,

27:10.850 --> 27:12.030
and power.

27:12.310 --> 27:13.350
Opportunities?

27:14.830 --> 27:15.510
Power?

27:15.530 --> 27:17.060
With your qualifications,

27:17.440 --> 27:19.240
you can only climb so high.

27:19.840 --> 27:21.770
Humans have such short lifespans.

27:21.790 --> 27:23.560
You might work hard your entire life

27:23.560 --> 27:24.590
and end up as nothing more than

27:24.590 --> 27:26.870
an insignificant small-time boss.

27:32.150 --> 27:32.830
Alright.

27:33.620 --> 27:34.250
Tell me,

27:35.510 --> 27:36.840
what can I do for you?

27:37.720 --> 27:40.030
Do you know where

27:40.310 --> 27:41.710
Dongfang Huaizhu is now?

27:43.070 --> 27:45.390
They've set off to the Drunken Dream Tower
in the Beast Kingdom

27:45.390 --> 27:46.920
to get the Twilight Mist Flower.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.240
Twilight Mist Flower?

27:49.440 --> 27:50.510
Jin Renfeng.

27:50.790 --> 27:52.160
Your primary task now

27:52.490 --> 27:54.350
is to beat Dongfang Huaizhu

27:54.350 --> 27:55.880
in finding the tower master

27:55.960 --> 27:57.640
and obtaining the Twilight Mist Flower.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.170
Why would they listen to me?

27:59.350 --> 28:01.720
Go send a message to the ruler of
the Beast Kingdom.

28:01.720 --> 28:05.370
Tell him that Wangquan Hongye is infiltrating
the Beast Kingdom.

28:05.370 --> 28:08.110
The ruler of the Beast Kingdom hates him
as much as you do.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.350
He will help you.

28:09.920 --> 28:11.030
Now is the perfect time

28:11.030 --> 28:13.920
to kill Wangquan Hongye.

28:20.000 --> 28:24.000
Wangquan Hongye and Dongfang Huaizhu have set off
to the Beast Kingdom.

28:24.530 --> 28:27.100
They are changing the course of fate.

28:27.350 --> 28:30.800
Lord Jiuhuo, you must stop them.

28:31.660 --> 28:33.660
Let me take some time to recuperate.

28:34.530 --> 28:37.210
I will go back to handle this matter personally.

28:37.520 --> 28:39.240
But that's too slow.

28:39.970 --> 28:43.200
Your demon core is severely damaged,
and your magical artifact has been destroyed.

28:43.200 --> 28:45.240
It won't be easy for you to go back.

28:46.590 --> 28:49.150
But human desires never cease.

28:51.990 --> 28:53.850
I've already placed my pawns.

28:54.400 --> 28:57.130
You mean that Jin Renfeng from Divine Fire Villa.

28:57.240 --> 29:00.350
I hope he won't disappoint me.

29:17.270 --> 29:18.160
Here, ladies.

29:18.390 --> 29:18.830
Sorry for the long wait.

29:18.830 --> 29:19.430
Thank you.

29:19.640 --> 29:20.440
Please enjoy.

29:22.400 --> 29:23.240
Huaizhu,

29:23.760 --> 29:25.440
so this is the Beast Kingdom.

29:25.960 --> 29:27.270
There are so many demons here.

29:27.270 --> 29:28.730
It's really interesting.

29:31.830 --> 29:35.310
The National Preceptor has ordered
the city gates to be closed.

29:35.310 --> 29:37.510
Everyone has to get their identity verified.

29:37.510 --> 29:38.310
Go over there.

29:38.440 --> 29:40.520
Nobody moves.

29:41.020 --> 29:42.920
Anyone who dares to act recklessly

29:42.920 --> 29:45.520
will be treated as a spy from
the Yiqi Alliance.

29:45.810 --> 29:46.570
Search them!

29:48.760 --> 29:49.530
Officer,

29:49.680 --> 29:50.880
what's going on?

29:50.880 --> 29:53.400
Recently, some disciples from the noble families
of the Yiqi Alliance

29:53.400 --> 29:55.400
have infiltrated our Beast Kingdom.

29:55.400 --> 29:57.840
Among all the guests in this tavern,

29:57.960 --> 29:59.590
those without identity tokens

29:59.590 --> 30:02.200
and those with tokens but no accompanying demons

30:02.200 --> 30:04.110
will all be taken away for questioning.

30:04.110 --> 30:04.700
You.

30:05.680 --> 30:06.310
Stop there.

30:06.310 --> 30:07.110
Move forward.

30:10.400 --> 30:11.510
Who are you two?

30:12.530 --> 30:13.210
Let him go.

30:14.270 --> 30:15.720
Show your identity tokens.

30:15.720 --> 30:17.180
We are from the Pulan Clan.

30:17.920 --> 30:18.750
Pulan Clan?

30:20.270 --> 30:21.480
Where are your accompanying demons?

30:21.480 --> 30:22.700
We didn't bring them with us.

30:22.700 --> 30:25.510
Dressed like nobles yet without demons.

30:26.160 --> 30:26.880
Suspicious.

30:26.880 --> 30:28.590
Not bringing them doesn't mean we don't have any.

30:28.590 --> 30:30.280
I forgot to bring my brain too.

30:30.300 --> 30:31.700
Stop being smart with me.

30:31.790 --> 30:32.430
Where's your token?

30:32.430 --> 30:33.290
Take them away.

30:34.510 --> 30:35.110
Come here.

30:38.640 --> 30:39.170
Let's go.

30:41.310 --> 30:42.070
Those in the back.

30:42.070 --> 30:42.640
Show your identity tokens.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.150
You.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.440
Go over there.

30:47.290 --> 30:48.000
Move.

30:48.850 --> 30:49.510
Yours.

30:52.560 --> 30:53.510
Madam.

30:53.830 --> 30:55.750
Go send a message to Ruyi Pavilion.

30:55.750 --> 30:59.190
These two look like they're from Divine Fire Villa.

30:59.350 --> 30:59.960
Got it.

31:01.250 --> 31:02.270
Let's go.

31:08.460 --> 31:09.390
Officer,

31:10.750 --> 31:12.760
it's almost dinner time.

31:12.960 --> 31:14.550
Even if you won't release us,

31:14.550 --> 31:16.230
at least give us some food.

31:17.210 --> 31:18.050
Be quiet.

31:18.920 --> 31:21.790
I've been so busy all day, and I'm just now
getting to eat some warm food.

31:21.790 --> 31:23.190
I'll deal with you later.

31:26.440 --> 31:28.530
Who's so bold as to even dare

31:28.680 --> 31:31.220
arrest the young ladies of our Erzhu family?

31:54.370 --> 31:55.260
Huaizhu!

31:56.350 --> 31:57.160
Ladies.

31:58.790 --> 32:00.590
I've finally found you, ladies.

32:05.520 --> 32:06.920
Why did you come only now?

32:09.110 --> 32:10.310
What did you just say?

32:10.750 --> 32:12.350
They are from the Erzhu Clan?

32:13.730 --> 32:16.060
They are even the young ladies of the clan?

32:17.100 --> 32:20.530
Would the young ladies of the Erzhu family

32:20.680 --> 32:21.790
run around the streets without
an identity token

32:21.790 --> 32:23.390
or any accompanying demons?

32:27.920 --> 32:30.640
Here's their identity token.

32:46.000 --> 32:46.800
Open the door.

32:48.070 --> 32:48.640
Hurry up.

32:53.400 --> 32:54.440
Why are you pushing me?

32:54.440 --> 32:55.400
If you gained a few less pounds,

32:55.400 --> 32:57.260
we wouldn't be blocking the door.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.350
My Lady.

33:06.510 --> 33:08.270
I apologize for being late.

33:08.270 --> 33:10.790
Sorry for having made you suffer.

33:16.600 --> 33:18.500
Qinlan, let's go.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.640
Right. Let's go.

33:23.030 --> 33:24.030
Stop right there.

33:28.110 --> 33:30.440
Although this identity token is genuine,

33:30.510 --> 33:32.750
the National Preceptor has given a strict order.

33:32.750 --> 33:35.310
We underlings don't dare to be careless.

33:35.790 --> 33:38.640
So, young ladies, could you please explain?

33:41.640 --> 33:42.610
Explain what?

33:43.870 --> 33:46.680
You two ladies just didn't
bring the identity token

33:46.680 --> 33:47.920
and had no accompanying demons with you.

33:47.920 --> 33:50.830
Why didn't you say anything
when you got arrested?

34:04.750 --> 34:06.920
Right, speaking of that,

34:07.070 --> 34:09.070
we haven't settled the score with you yet.

34:09.070 --> 34:10.360
For no reason at all,

34:10.440 --> 34:12.800
you arrested the young lady of our Erzhu family.

34:12.800 --> 34:14.710
And now you're questioning our young lady?

34:14.710 --> 34:17.310
You... You're making your offense even worse!

34:19.320 --> 34:22.090
If you don't give a reasonable explanation,

34:22.150 --> 34:25.010
I'll sit in this jail until I wear a hole
in the floor!

34:25.030 --> 34:25.650
You...

34:26.090 --> 34:26.550
Wait...

34:26.550 --> 34:28.510
We're not leaving anymore.

34:28.510 --> 34:29.380
This, this...

34:29.550 --> 34:30.630
Look how dilapidated this jail cell is.

34:30.630 --> 34:33.090
At night, it's full of cockroaches and rats.

34:35.190 --> 34:36.360
Look, this place is really filthy.

34:36.360 --> 34:38.420
Please, let your demon carry you out.

34:38.880 --> 34:40.010
I can walk by myself.

34:41.320 --> 34:42.440
-Let's go.
-Come on, let's go.

34:42.440 --> 34:44.150
Huaizhu, wait for me!

34:44.280 --> 34:45.280
Let's go.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.630
What's the rush?

34:49.590 --> 34:50.440
Be careful. Be careful.

34:50.440 --> 34:51.670
Bro, be careful.

34:53.150 --> 34:54.290
What are you doing?

34:58.910 --> 35:00.030
Give it to me.

35:04.690 --> 35:07.750
This humble one respectfully
sees you off, Miss Erzhu.

35:26.760 --> 35:27.900
That was close.

35:28.360 --> 35:31.890
If we had delayed any longer, we would
have been caught for sure.

35:32.590 --> 35:34.470
So it's you two.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.170
I really couldn't tell.

35:40.880 --> 35:42.940
How are you? You're not hurt, are you?

35:44.320 --> 35:45.030
I'm fine.

35:46.150 --> 35:48.760
So that screeching female demon just now

35:48.840 --> 35:49.800
was you, huh?

35:50.000 --> 35:51.930
Is this how you talk to your savior?

35:53.350 --> 35:54.150
This is great.

35:55.220 --> 35:57.220
I didn't expect to run into you here.

35:58.800 --> 35:59.760
I thought...

36:03.670 --> 36:05.000
Just talk if you want to talk.

36:05.000 --> 36:06.730
Why are you getting all handsy?

36:06.960 --> 36:08.960
Sorry for the offense, Miss Qinlan.

36:09.880 --> 36:10.940
However, Huaizhu,

36:10.960 --> 36:13.360
how did you know those two demons were them?

36:13.670 --> 36:15.150
Li Quzhuo had something written on his hand.

36:15.150 --> 36:16.070
What was it?

36:21.220 --> 36:22.790
[Sister-in-law]

36:34.920 --> 36:35.880
What was it?

36:45.150 --> 36:46.000
It's gone.

36:46.760 --> 36:47.700
You...

36:48.150 --> 36:48.840
It's gone.

36:49.950 --> 36:52.160
How did you know we were here?

36:53.360 --> 36:55.670
Hongye heard at Ruyi Pavilion that
you were arrested.

36:55.670 --> 36:57.150
He was beside himself with worry.

36:57.150 --> 37:00.400
He was even ready to storm the Beast Kingdom
with his sword.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.400
Guess what I said.

37:01.670 --> 37:03.670
"Hongye, don't be hasty.

37:04.440 --> 37:07.320
Let me think of a foolproof plan."

37:07.740 --> 37:08.070
So...

37:08.070 --> 37:09.360
In short,

37:09.800 --> 37:12.400
Qingmu Yuan gave us
demon disguise talismans.

37:14.230 --> 37:15.030
Thanks a lot.

37:16.440 --> 37:18.700
Although I don't know your purpose here,

37:18.840 --> 37:22.030
given the current situation, why don't we...

37:22.440 --> 37:23.550
There's no need for that.

37:23.550 --> 37:25.350
Let's just go our separate ways.

37:25.400 --> 37:27.110
Now the entire Beast Kingdom is on high alert,

37:27.110 --> 37:28.400
hunting for members of the Yiqi Alliance.

37:28.400 --> 37:31.060
If we stay with you, we'll be in
even more danger.

37:32.110 --> 37:32.840
That's true.

37:34.150 --> 37:34.710
Quzhuo.

37:38.110 --> 37:40.030
Take these two identity tokens.

37:40.360 --> 37:42.880
If anything happens, come find me
at Ruyi Pavilion.

37:42.880 --> 37:43.940
But what about you?

37:44.220 --> 37:45.060
We have more.

37:49.000 --> 37:49.800
Let's go, Huaizhu.

37:49.800 --> 37:51.930
His eyes are practically glued to you.

38:01.620 --> 38:02.270
Let's go.
